<section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Last updated: September 2, 2026</p></div></section>
<main class="policy"><div class="wrap"><div class="policy-card">
<p>The Pixie Packed Family ("we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains the types of information that may be collected when you visit pixiepackedfamily.com, how that information may be used, and some of the third-party services that may process information in connection with the site.</p>
<h2>Information You Provide</h2><p>You may voluntarily provide information to us when you use features such as an email signup form, contact form, downloadable-resource signup, or other interactive features.</p><p>Depending on the feature, this may include information such as your name, email address, or information you choose to include in a message.</p><p>We use information you provide for the purpose for which it was submitted, such as delivering a requested resource, communicating with you, or sending email content you have chosen to receive.</p>
<h2>Website Analytics</h2><p>We use analytics services, including Google Analytics, to understand how visitors use The Pixie Packed Family.</p><p>Analytics information may include data such as pages viewed, approximate geographic area, device or browser type, referring source, session activity, and similar usage information.</p><p>We use this information to understand website performance, improve content, and learn which resources are useful to visitors.</p>
<h2>Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2><p>The site and third-party services used by the site may use cookies or similar technologies to operate features, understand website usage, remember preferences, or measure performance.</p><p>Your browser may allow you to block or delete cookies. Disabling cookies may affect how some website features function.</p>
<h2>Email Communications</h2><p>If you choose to join our email list or request a resource by email, your information may be processed by the email-service provider we use to manage subscriptions and deliver messages.</p><p>You may unsubscribe from marketing emails using the unsubscribe link included in those messages.</p>
<h2>Affiliate Links</h2><p>The Pixie Packed Family participates in affiliate programs, including the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program.</p><p>Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you click an affiliate link and make a qualifying purchase, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you.</p><p>Affiliate partners and retailers may use cookies or other tracking technologies in accordance with their own privacy policies to attribute purchases or measure referral activity.</p>
<h2>Third-Party Links and Services</h2><p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites, retailers, social-media platforms, or other services.</p><p>We do not control the privacy practices of those third parties. Information you provide directly to a third-party website or service is governed by that third party's privacy policy.</p>
<h2>Social Media</h2><p>The Pixie Packed Family maintains profiles on third-party social-media platforms. If you interact with us through those platforms, the platform may collect or process information according to its own terms and privacy practices.</p>
<h2>Children's Privacy</h2><p>The Pixie Packed Family is intended for a general audience and is not directed toward children under 13.</p><p>We do not knowingly request personal information directly from children under 13 through this website. If we learn that personal information from a child under 13 has been submitted to us through the site, we will take reasonable steps to address it.</p>
<h2>Data Retention and Security</h2><p>We retain information for as long as reasonably necessary for the purpose for which it was collected, to operate the website and related services, or as otherwise appropriate for legitimate business needs.</p><p>We take reasonable steps to protect information, but no method of electronic transmission or storage can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>
<h2>Your Choices</h2><p>Depending on how you interact with the site, you may be able to:</p><ul><li>unsubscribe from marketing emails;</li><li>adjust cookie settings through your browser;</li><li>contact us with questions about information you previously provided; or</li><li>ask us to update or delete information that we reasonably control, subject to applicable limitations.</li></ul>
<h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2><p>We may update this Privacy Policy as the website, our services, or the third-party tools we use change.</p><p>When we make changes, we will update the "Last updated" date shown at the top of this page.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or privacy practices associated with The Pixie Packed Family, please contact us through the contact method currently provided on pixiepackedfamily.com.</p>
